["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; 2005 Stanford Commencement Address (with intro by President John Hennessy) Whole Earth Catalog\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2005-06-12-ch-stanford-乔布斯-被苹果开除-是我经历过最好的事情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12db0bcde8d71255-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2005</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯：被蘋果開除，是我經歷過最好的事情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">30歲被自己創立的公司公開解僱後，喬布斯才進入人生最有創造力的五年，催生了NeXT和Pixar,最終帶著那段技術重新回到蘋果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">職業挫折</span>\n</div></div></a>"]